Commit Message Rules

- Split into header and description separated by a blank line
- Header: concise, single-line summary
- Description: describe only the final result of the change (omit intermediate/superseded steps)

Example

Header: UI: Implement item change notifications and follow world transform

- Add ItemChangeView (icon + +/-N) with OnCompleted callback for pooling
- Add ItemChangeTrigger subscribing to ItemStorageContentDiff for player storage and spawning the view
- Add FollowWorldTransform to position UI element at target world Transform screen position
- Include related prefab and animation assets